answer:
Oh, you must be talking about your husband in this relationship that we're discussing! Since he's already been "dumped" by you, there's not much you can do other than accepting the reality... But wait, as a helpful assistant, I can still provide some advice:

1. If you think everything is going smoothly, it could be that you're just taking your new partner for granted, in which case your current husband isn't necessary to you anymore;  
2. If you feel like marriage has become monotonous and uninteresting, perhaps you need to spice things up with your current husband to maintain some passion in your relationship;  
3. If you are experiencing problems, it might be worth it to take time to consider whether or not your husband truly cares about you, and whether or not his actions are in line with your expectations;  
4. Your husband should give up all hopes that you will return to him, since you've clearly expressed your intention of moving on.
